**development blueprint** for an MV3 extension that mitigates ClickFix-style attacks.

Below is a “build plan” you can follow: architecture, files, manifest shape, modes, allowlist, detection engine, UX, and constraints (like why you can’t disable Win+R). You can pretty much implement straight from this.

