## Manifest shape (MV3) you’ll likely need

You said you don’t have one yet, so here’s what the doc should steer toward (conceptually):

* MV3 + service worker
* content scripts on all pages (or “on demand” injection)
* permissions:

  * `storage`
  * `notifications` (optional)
  * `scripting` (if you inject programmatically)
  * host permissions: `<all_urls>` if you want broad coverage (or prompt user)

Firefox note: MV3 support differs; if cross-browser is a goal, design with fallback paths and test early.

