## Interference with other extensions (how to minimize)

Document and design for coexistence:

* Patch minimally; preserve original functions and call-through on allow
* Don’t permanently override if not needed (e.g., only intercept when mode != Off)
* Avoid `stopImmediatePropagation()` except when blocking
* Provide per-site Off + allowlist to resolve conflicts fast
* Log reason codes so users can troubleshoot (“Blocked: no user intent in Strict mode”)

